      "content": "Given the inconsistent supplier profile, I would advise caution. While the certificates appear authentic, the recent merger with a mass-producer in Spain raises doubts about the single-origin status. If cleared immediately without further investigation, this could lead to reputation damage or customer complaints. I would recommend flagging the shipment for a reminder lab audit before clearing it for intake.",
